Summary:
Today’s session involved debugging and improving the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform. The focus was on identifying and fixing issues in both frontend and backend components to ensure smooth functionality. Errors related to API calls, data handling, and UI behavior were reviewed and corrected. Minor enhancements were also made to improve overall system performance and user experience.

Outcomes:
Several bugs were successfully resolved, resulting in a more stable and reliable system. The interaction between frontend and backend became smoother after fixing integration issues. Improvements in performance and usability were achieved. This step enhanced the overall quality of the application and prepared it for final testing and deployment readiness.
